    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d468">

                <pb facs="0559" n="463" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg463"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Baron Fava to Mr.
                            Adee.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lenox, Mass.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-09-19"><hi rendition="#italic">September 19,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Anxious to learn the contents of New Orleans report and your appreciations upon
                    it. Am waiting for kind and prompt information, urgently requested from my
                    Government. Thanks.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fava.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
